# Concept 5 — Cockpit (linked widgets, drill-down)

Philosophy: widgets are not islands — they LINK. Summary tiles on the
left act as selectors; the main area re-renders for the selection.
One dashboard replaces N static ones; state lives in the URL
(?focus=...), never in the saved body.

