Model change: selector widgets get target: widgetGroupId; detail
widgets get inherit: "conditions" | "conceptId". Clicking a selector
swaps the inherited filter context of the detail group.

Best for: power users, "BI-lite" exploration without leaving the
dashboard. Cost: biggest contract + renderer change of the five;
needs careful empty/loading states per swap.
